# LifeControl - Secret file template: lifecontrol_app_password
# Copy to docker/secrets/lifecontrol_app_password and replace the CHANGEME value
# with the real password of the lifecontrol_app role (ADR-0005). The file is
# mounted read-only into the lifecontrol-postgres container, which creates the
# role with it, and into the lifecontrol-api container, which will connect the
# pool with it. The credential never travels in a .env or in a compose file.
#
# Do NOT commit the materialized secrets file (gitignored via docker/secrets/*).
# setup-env.sh materializes this template (stripping comment lines) and chmod 0444.
CHANGEME
